() Tj T*
(WHEREAS the Landlord is the owner of the residential flat situated at Flat No. 204,) Tj T*
(Green Park Apartments, Saket, New Delhi - 110017 measuring 950 sq ft, and the Tenant has) Tj T*
(agreed to take the said premises on rent for residential purposes only.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(NOW THIS AGREEMENT WITNESSETH AS UNDER:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. TERM: The tenancy shall be for a period of eleven \(11\) months commencing from 1st) Tj T*
(January 2024.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. RENT: The Tenant shall pay a monthly rent of Rs. 25,000/- \(Rupees Twenty Five) Tj T*
(Thousand only\) per month on or before the 5th day of each month.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. SECURITY DEPOSIT: The Tenant has paid an interest-free security deposit of Rs.) Tj T*
(1,00,000/- which shall be refunded at the time of vacating the premises after deducting) Tj T*
(any dues.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. LATE PAYMENT: In case of delay in payment of rent, a late fee of Rs. 500 per day) Tj T*
(shall be charged to the Tenant.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. MAINTENANCE: The Tenant shall pay the society maintenance charges and keep the) Tj T*
(premises clean and in good condition.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. REPAIRS: The Tenant shall be responsible for all structural repairs of the premises) Tj T*
(during the tenancy.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. UTILITIES: The Tenant shall pay the electricity and water bills as per the meter) Tj T*
(readings directly to the concerned authorities.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8. TERMINATION: The Landlord may terminate this agreement at any time without assigning) Tj T*
(any reason. The Tenant may vacate the premises by giving 7 days notice in writing.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(9. INSPECTION: The Landlord or his agent may enter the premises at any time for) Tj T*
(inspection.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(10. RENEWAL: This agreement shall be renewed automatically for a further period of) Tj T*
(eleven months unless terminated.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(11. JURISDICTION: This agreement shall be governed by the laws of India and the courts) Tj T*
(at New Delhi shall have exclusive jurisdiction.) Tj T*
